From: Darcy Phipps <dphipps@qnx.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Mar 2025 10:41:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 55/60] Add VLC_LIB_PATH

Provide a way to override the hard coded VLC lib directory, set at
compile time. Makes it easier to deal with situations where the location
VLC is built/installed on the host is NOT the same as where it will be
run on the target.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific (from qnx-ports)

diff --git a/src/posix/dirs.c b/src/posix/dirs.c
index 31f4a175301..d4e9c1f37f6 100644
--- a/src/posix/dirs.c
+++ b/src/posix/dirs.c
@@ -54,7 +54,8 @@ char *config_GetDataDir (void)
  */
 char *config_GetLibDir (void)
 {
-    return strdup (PKGLIBDIR);
+    const char *path = getenv ("VLC_LIB_PATH");
+    return strdup ((path != NULL) ? path : PKGLIBDIR);
 }
 #endif
 

